WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-IN

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.999
Smoking causes cancer.
Smoking kills.
 

00:00:05.999 --> 00:00:11.518
Drinking alcohol
is injurious to health.

00:00:11.518 --> 00:00:17.238
[Music]

00:00:17.961 --> 00:00:41.000
[Background Murugar Song]

00:00:46.621 --> 00:00:50.909
Hello… Hello sir…
Sir, can you hear me?

00:00:50.909 --> 00:00:54.375
Yes sir… one minute sir…
Just one minute…

00:00:55.198 --> 00:00:59.170
Hello sir, tell me sir.
Dheera, there’s nothing more to say.

00:00:59.170 --> 00:01:02.782
Your name is already on the layoff list.
You still haven’t completed your target.

00:01:02.782 --> 00:01:07.010
If the amount doesn’t come by evening, I’m sorry…
After that, I can’t do anything.

00:01:08.797 --> 00:01:12.509
I’ll definitely come with the money and meet you this evening, sir.
Sure?

00:01:12.509 --> 00:01:14.354
Sure sir

00:01:14.354 --> 00:01:15.677
Ok, Make it fast

00:01:19.121 --> 00:01:22.565
People sitting comfortably in AC rooms giving advice don’t know the real pain.

00:01:25.594 --> 00:01:26.916
Don't die man

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:30.164
At this rate, I’ll die before finishing collections.

00:01:41.183 --> 00:01:47.434
[Bell Rings]

00:01:49.234 --> 00:01:50.399
 Is this Raghav’s house? 

00:01:50.399 --> 00:01:52.551
Yes. Who are you?

00:01:52.734 --> 00:01:57.334
I’m Dheera. Collection agent.
He asked me to come home for EMI collection. Is he not here?

00:01:57.495 --> 00:02:00.034
No, he’s gone out.

00:02:00.501 --> 00:02:02.413
Gone out? Who are you?

00:02:02.413 --> 00:02:04.077
I’m his friend. 

00:02:04.077 --> 00:02:08.572
Do you know when he’ll be back?
Half an hour to one hour.

00:02:08.572 --> 00:02:12.579
Half an hour… Raghav… Raghav…

00:02:15.911 --> 00:02:16.807
He wont pick 

00:02:16.807 --> 00:02:20.855
Why?
He left his phone at home.

00:02:20.855 --> 00:02:23.845
Left it here?

00:02:24.467 --> 00:02:28.478
If you’re waiting, come inside and sit, bro. 

00:02:28.839 --> 00:02:32.470
No bro, I’ll wait outside.
It’s okay bro, come in.

00:02:33.915 --> 00:02:37.983
Let’s have coffee. It’s getting late anyway.

00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:40.467
Okay, fine.

00:02:42.635 --> 00:02:46.000
Looks like he really went out.

00:02:50.377 --> 00:02:54.521
Please sit, brother.
Thalapathi, huh?

00:03:00.423 --> 00:03:04.250
What bro? Tea or coffee?

00:03:04.892 --> 00:03:06.892
Coffee.
hmm 

00:03:07.260 --> 00:03:08.784
Looks  like a genuinely good person.

00:03:08.784 --> 00:03:13.093
[Thalapathy Movie Plays]

00:03:13.093 --> 00:03:15.601
Why is this coffee such a strange color?
Is this black coffee?

00:03:16.183 --> 00:03:17.802
Coffee or Drinks?

00:03:18.163 --> 00:03:20.163
Bro, just coffee. I’ve got work.

00:03:28.219 --> 00:03:29.667
Bro, the coffee is good.

00:03:30.651 --> 00:03:31.740
Thanks.

00:03:36.772 --> 00:03:41.804
Bro, is Raghav a doctor?
No, medical student.

00:03:41.804 --> 00:03:42.685
Which college?

00:03:44.258 --> 00:03:46.455
Tiruppur Medical College.

00:03:46.455 --> 00:03:47.050
You too?

00:03:47.793 --> 00:03:48.548
Yes

00:03:48.548 --> 00:03:54.229
Bro, I have a doubt.
For many days, I’ve had pain on the left side of my head. 

00:03:54.229 --> 00:03:56.034
Do you smoke a lot?

00:03:56.195 --> 00:03:57.352
Bro, how do you know?

00:03:57.352 --> 00:04:01.380
Dark lips. Anyone can tell.

00:04:01.882 --> 00:04:06.317
Bro, one small doubt.
Any idea to get rid of headache without quitting cigarettes?

00:04:06.317 --> 00:04:10.626
I have an idea.
What bro?

00:04:10.626 --> 00:04:14.097
How many cigarettes do you smoke a day?

00:04:14.097 --> 00:04:16.097
About five.

00:04:16.418 --> 00:04:23.417
Smoke ten a day. The pain will go.

00:04:25.726 --> 00:04:30.181
I asked for peaceful sleep, he’s giving me an idea to sleep forever. 
Mental Fellow

00:04:31.185 --> 00:04:32.583
What?

00:04:32.583 --> 00:04:35.727
Nothing bro.
I said once my salary comes, I’ll buy more cigarettes.

00:04:37.393 --> 00:04:43.388
Why? Too many cigarettes?
Too much work pressure?

00:04:44.211 --> 00:04:49.096
It’s a dog’s life, bro. Running behind people to collect money, life drains out and comes back.

00:04:49.096 --> 00:04:55.292
Someone takes compound loan, personal loan, loan after loan.
When we call and ask for EMI,

00:04:55.292 --> 00:04:59.727
“This week bro… next week bro… next month bro…”
And when we trust them and go to the bank,

00:04:59.727 --> 00:05:04.036
the manager scolds us saying,
“Can’t you even collect money properly?”

00:05:04.036 --> 00:05:10.000
Handling all this and reaching target just to get salary…
It becomes unbearable, bro.

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:14.710
Looks like five cigarettes aren’t enough for your suffering.

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:19.340
Five?
Even ten won’t be enough. 

00:05:20.987 --> 00:05:33.563
[Scene from Thalapathy Movie]

00:05:33.563 --> 00:05:35.321
Anyway, he is going to die in the movie

00:05:37.148 --> 00:05:40.152
You really like Thalapathi?

00:05:40.152 --> 00:05:43.959
Who doesn’t like Thalapathi?
It’s about friendship.

00:05:43.959 --> 00:05:45.959
Friendship?

00:05:46.300 --> 00:05:49.832
What do you think about friendship? 

00:05:50.555 --> 00:05:52.555
What?

00:05:52.876 --> 00:05:57.400
I asked what you think about friendship. 

00:05:57.400 --> 00:06:00.344
Why are you suddenly asking?
Just tell me. 

00:06:01.428 --> 00:06:10.107
Friendship means being happy. Knowing each other’s plus and minus.Like this… making coffee and offering it.
That’s it.

00:06:13.166 --> 00:06:22.212
You said plus and minus…
What’s my minus?

00:06:23.397 --> 00:06:26.441
I know bro.
Stammering Problem. I adjust

00:06:31.942 --> 00:06:38.941
Am I that bad that you have to adjust?

00:06:39.363 --> 00:06:43.113
Sorry bro, I didn’t mean it that way.
Don’t misunderstand.

00:06:43.454 --> 00:06:47.367
Chill bro. Friends.

00:06:51.282 --> 00:06:54.701
Can I call you by your name?

00:06:54.701 --> 00:06:56.613
Why not bro? Call me.  

00:06:56.613 --> 00:06:57.930
Ram

00:06:57.930 --> 00:07:00.914
What? 
Hey… sounds like drunk and blabbering.

00:07:00.914 --> 00:07:03.883
Ram. That’s my name.
Okay Ram.

00:07:04.224 --> 00:07:07.195
Did you ever have any ambition?

00:07:07.867 --> 00:07:08.729
Ambition?

00:07:09.025 --> 00:07:10.937
asked suddenly…
Mm

00:07:11.775 --> 00:07:12.727
 Yes.
I did, bro.

00:07:12.727 --> 00:07:17.276
I wanted to become a big person in archery.
But situations forced me to quit.

00:07:18.561 --> 00:07:23.472
Why? No support from family or friends?

00:07:24.388 --> 00:07:30.444
Family didn’t support much.
Friends still ask what happened to my ambition.

00:07:30.444 --> 00:07:36.747
An archery kit itself costs more than 60,000.
Our desires are always too expensive.

00:07:37.370 --> 00:07:38.848
So I gave it up. 

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:48.834
Not like you.
I had a small dream. I wanted to become an actor.

00:07:49.075 --> 00:07:52.199
Wow. That’s the biggest dream of all.

00:07:52.821 --> 00:08:02.148
Okay, listen. Its my big dream okay?
Okay.. Okay..

00:08:03.292 --> 00:08:15.638
I worked hard, saved money,
Produced, directed, and acted in a short film myself.

00:08:16.461 --> 00:08:25.473
It cost less than your archery kit.
Only 20,000.

00:08:25.473 --> 00:08:28.216
Stop joking and tell.

00:08:28.216 --> 00:08:35.120
My friend Raghav—
He’s not just my friend, he’s an influencer.

00:08:36.244 --> 00:08:42.540
I asked him to promote my short film.
He did.

00:08:43.223 --> 00:08:47.311
That’s good. Views must have poured in.
Yes, views came well.

00:08:47.813 --> 00:08:51.867
But do you know what he did, Dheera?
What?

00:08:53.292 --> 00:08:57.405
Hey Raghav! What nonsense did you do?

00:08:57.847 --> 00:08:59.024
What did I do?

00:09:01.425 --> 00:09:08.845
I asked you to promote my short film.
Why did you unnecessarily talk about me?

00:09:09.528 --> 00:09:11.075
What did I say?

00:09:13.805 --> 00:09:18.314
You said I keep pausing while talking. 

00:09:21.547 --> 00:09:25.259
That’s what audience likes!

00:09:26.996 --> 00:09:32.186
If you wanted someone who talks in rhyme,was my problem the only one available? Who gave you rights to insult me?

00:09:32.186 --> 00:09:38.944
Why are you overreacting?
I treated you like a friend.  Friend?

00:09:38.944 --> 00:09:44.016
With that stammering problem, you talk like this?
If your conversation is so good?

00:09:44.016 --> 00:09:47.326
Go fix it first and then talk.

00:09:47.326 --> 00:09:50.516
Don’t talk unnecessarily.

00:09:53.487 --> 00:09:58.960
Tell me Dheera,
Is it my fault that I was born like this?

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:06.919
Mr. Bean, Hrithik Roshan—
they all had this problem, didn’t they?

00:10:07.682 --> 00:10:15.601
They became actors, right?
Why can’t I?

00:10:15.601 --> 00:10:17.568
You could’ve punched him at least once, Ram.

00:10:17.568 --> 00:10:21.234
After that he wouldn’t talk like this.
Correct, Dheera.

00:10:21.234 --> 00:10:26.432
Correct, Dheera.
I hit him.

00:10:26.432 --> 00:10:28.432
Did you hit him?

00:10:28.954 --> 00:10:31.040
I hit him.

00:10:32.204 --> 00:10:34.204
He died.  

00:10:34.204 --> 00:10:34.704
What?

00:10:35.909 --> 00:10:37.909
I hit him.

00:10:41.844 --> 00:10:42.800
He died.

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:48.441
Looks like he really went *****

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:53.988
Don’t joke, Ram.
I’m leaving. Tell Raghav to call me when he comes.

00:11:08.832 --> 00:11:21.593
Sorry, Dheera.Time brought you here.
Time made me come here.

00:11:24.143 --> 00:11:29.817
Time made me kill him.
Time made you the scapegoat.

00:11:30.198 --> 00:11:36.053
I didn’t expect this.
After he died, I didn’t know what to do.

00:11:36.734 --> 00:11:40.446
Then I heard a vehicle stop downstairs.

00:11:42.213 --> 00:11:44.213
I went to check who it was.

00:11:44.713 --> 00:11:48.104
That’s when I saw you.

00:11:48.104 --> 00:11:51.992
I already seen you dheera
when you came to collect EMI earlier.

00:11:52.474 --> 00:11:57.947
I guessed you’d come here somehow.
I decided to trap you.

00:11:59.661 --> 00:12:07.588
Don’t worry, Dheera. Tomorrow morning when you wake up,
you won’t remember anything that happened here.

00:12:07.588 --> 00:12:12.334
You won’t remember my friend.
You won’t remember me either.

00:12:14.422 --> 00:12:19.636
You’re scared?
Won’t you do even this much for a friend, Dheera?

00:12:21.282 --> 00:12:23.282
Do you know what tomorrow’s news will be?

00:12:25.551 --> 00:12:32.878
“A collection agent murdered a person
for failing to repay loan EMI.”

00:12:34.728 --> 00:12:39.349
“At the scene of the murder,
the accused collapsed unconscious.”

00:12:39.831 --> 00:12:46.549
Perfect, isn’t it?
What acting!

00:12:46.549 --> 00:12:50.000
No, Ram.
I have a family.

00:12:51.767 --> 00:12:53.767
I also have a family, Dheera.

00:13:00.613 --> 00:13:13.015
 ["Kattukuyilu" Song from Thalapathy]

00:13:13.015 --> 00:13:16.300
Bell Rings &amp; Door Knocks

00:13:16.300 --> 00:13:31.945
Title: THALAPATHY

00:13:31.945 --> 00:13:41.700
Subtitle by HARISH K KRISH 

